# Save anywhere, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/snapcfg: the CD's LBA.CFG
# with the key): a new game, its text and movie cut, a walk in the cell.
# Escape writes current.lba and opens the main menu over the game, under
# its picture: Resume Game, New Game, Load Game, Save Game, Options
# Menu, Quit. Save Game opens the list of saves, whose New Game line
# names the save abc, which holds the scene as Escape left it, and the
# menu comes back. Resume Game goes on with the game. A walk, Escape,
# and Load Game lists abc and AUTOSAVE: abc loads, grown out of its
# picture, Twinsen where he stood at the first Escape.

